perdu's icon and favicon

Copyright 2026 The perdu authors. All rights reserved.

This licence covers perdu's icon, its variants and its favicon: the SVG
files in this directory, and their copies wherever perdu's files carry
them, such as in perdu's binary and image, on its manual's site, and in
the pages perdu serves. The licences of perdu's other files don't cover
them.

You may, without asking:

1. Redistribute them unmodified as part of perdu, such as in copies of
   perdu's image or of its public repository.
2. Use them unmodified to refer to perdu, such as in an article about
   perdu, beside a link to perdu's site or repository, or on a dashboard's
   tile linking to a perdu instance.

Scaling them, converting them to another image format, such as PNG or
ICO, and styling them through the custom properties they read, as the
pages perdu serves do, doesn't modify them.

Any other use, modified or not, needs the permission of the perdu authors,
which you can ask for through perdu's public repository,
https://github.com/crazygolem/perdu.

THE FILES ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND.
